  <jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfConsolidatedSubsidiaryAcquiredByPurchaseOfSharesDuringReportingPeriodTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2021年８月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2022年７月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;重要性&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfConsolidatedSubsidiaryAcquiredByPurchaseOfSharesDuringReportingPeriodTextBlock>
